# The build context is the repository root, because both images install from the one lockfile.
# Everything below is either rebuilt inside the image or must never reach it.

# Installed and built inside the image, for its platform — a macOS node_modules carries the wrong
# native binaries (argon2, sharp, Prisma's engines) for a Linux container.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api/src/generated

# A developer's local secrets. apps/api reads `.env` with dotenv at boot, so a copied file would
# quietly override what the stack passes in.
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.github
.husky
.changeset
.claude
.playwright-mcp
docs
assets
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
*.png
